{"4480360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boss Pit", "steam_appid": 4480360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Pit is a boss rush game inspired by classic Punch-Out!!  Instead of boxing, you'll take on an intense array of fantasy monsters with a sword and shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/f811762df0574b1ae1b9813c65d4ef19.poster.avif?t=1784636174\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/f811762df0574b1ae1b9813c65d4ef19.webm?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/f811762df0574b1ae1b9813c65d4ef19.mp4?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three different difficulties starting with &quot;Hard&quot; and ending with &quot;Beat me senseless&quot;, be ready for souls-like challenging boss fights with cartoon style twist.  The game features heavily stylized art and music inspired by  cartoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/562a36aa7d15c66971b98672dc89a683.poster.avif?t=1784636174\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/562a36aa7d15c66971b98672dc89a683.webm?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/562a36aa7d15c66971b98672dc89a683.mp4?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be at least 10 bosses, each with their own unique mechanics and patterns to memorize.  A progression system allows you to upgrade  and customize Sir Scrapsalot, our beloved protagonist, between battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/eae3dadb8b1e1a9deee252d0971e3405.poster.avif?t=1784636174\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/eae3dadb8b1e1a9deee252d0971e3405.webm?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/eae3dadb8b1e1a9deee252d0971e3405.mp4?t=1784636174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>ALL OF THE ART, SOUND, AND MUSIC ARE HUMAN MADE. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/9fa0df576ac81ce0b8c8d2ebb3a7e5aa.avif?t=1784636174\" width=1280 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> </i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Pit is a boss rush game inspired by classic Punch-Out!!  Instead of boxing, you'll take on an intense array of fantasy monsters with a sword and shield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/f811762df0574b1ae1b9813c65d4ef19.poster.avif?t=1784636174\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480360/extras/f811762df0574b1a